  "method": "Each variant builds an FP16 engine (BuilderFlag.FP16, TF32 off, default profile) with the listed layers' compute and floating-point outputs forced to FP32 under OBEY_PRECISION_CONSTRAINTS, then compares per-clip logits and greedy transcripts with the FP32 engine. 'median_max_logit_error' is the median over clips of the largest absolute logit difference; the largest errors sit in tail (non-top) logits of the 10,288-entry vocabulary and do not affect decoding. Latency is per clip relative to the FP32 engine (lower is faster).",
